Package: selectrgev
Type: Package
Title: Selection of r-Largest Order Statistics via GEV-Based Models
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-08-31
Authors@R: person("Pjihong", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "pjihong@example.com")
Description: Provides tools for selecting the optimal number of r-largest
    order statistics using GEV-based models (RGEV and RGEV11). The main
    functions rsel.rgev() and rsel.rgev11() implement sequential selection
    procedures based on goodness-of-fit tests including energy distance (ed),
    complementary CDF (ccdf), and spacing methods. The updated main program
    rsel.rgev.SeqStop() implements sequential selection with stopping rules
    (ForwardStop and StrongStop) adjusted for sequential testing.
